1
00:01:31,730 --> 00:01:35,080
[In my prime]

2
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:37,720
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,000
Mr. Cao, I'm so sorry.

4
00:01:40,590 --> 00:01:41,710
When we were hiring,

5
00:01:41,710 --> 00:01:42,710
the security section

6
00:01:42,710 --> 00:01:43,970
had no problem with it.

7
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,680
Now suddenly they're saying

8
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:47,140
you're over the age limit.

9
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,289
If you ask me,

10
00:01:49,509 --> 00:01:51,310
you must've ticked someone off.

11
00:01:51,789 --> 00:01:52,390
It's fine.

12
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:53,550
It's fine.

13
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,600
It's fine.

14
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,060
See, you still have

15
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,920
the style of Chief Cao.

16
00:01:59,490 --> 00:02:01,290
You're just not cut out for this.

17
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,030
Dongfang,

18
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,240
honestly,

19
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:21,590
it's fine to quit

20
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,120
the security job.

21
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,190
At your age,

22
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,079
you can't run around anymore.

23
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:29,960
And if you get hurt or something,

24
00:02:30,079 --> 00:02:31,079
I'd worry.

25
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,280
I can

26
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,960
quit this job,

27
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,470
but what about the money

28
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:39,000
for the kid's study abroad?

29
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,030
I have money.

30
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:41,520
The 50,000 I saved

31
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,480
will come in handy.

32
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,890
How can I use your money?

33
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:44,320
Look,

34
00:02:44,370 --> 00:02:45,870
that's your retirement money.

35
00:02:45,870 --> 00:02:47,530
Why stand on ceremony with me?

36
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,150
But then again,

37
00:02:49,750 --> 00:02:51,470
even if we used your money,

38
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:52,950
that 50,000

39
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,960
won't solve the problem.

40
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,329
Studying abroad

41
00:02:57,710 --> 00:02:59,470
costs a fortune.

42
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:06,870
Dad,

43
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,560
I want to discuss something with you.

44
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,090
Go ahead.

45
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:14,750
I'm thinking...

46
00:03:19,310 --> 00:03:20,040
I'm thinking

47
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,910
of selling this house.

48
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,190
Sell the house?

49
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:29,120
Where will we live then?

50
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:30,600
We'll go to Haizhou.

51
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,680
What are you laughing at?

52
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,210
Nothing.

53
00:03:42,910 --> 00:03:43,590
I just thought of

54
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:44,490
the first time

55
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,850
I met you at the library.

56
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:47,120
You walked out of here,

57
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,630
and I couldn't keep up with you at all.

58
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,310
One step for you

59
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:50,280
was two for me.

60
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,079
It's different now.

61
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:53,079
We're in step now.

62
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:54,840
So did I slow down,

63
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,900
or did you speed up?

64
00:03:57,310 --> 00:03:58,240
Doesn't matter.

65
00:03:58,470 --> 00:03:59,930
The result is good anyway.

66
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,470
Should we

67
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:01,930
find a place to celebrate?

68
00:04:03,430 --> 00:04:03,760
Okay.

69
00:04:04,270 --> 00:04:04,980
My treat.

70
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,470
Let's find

71
00:04:06,890 --> 00:04:08,000
a nice place.

72
00:04:10,470 --> 00:04:12,130
You like Western food so much.

73
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:13,000
You'll definitely adapt better than me

74
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,010
when we go abroad.

75
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:17,540
Actually...

76
00:04:18,870 --> 00:04:20,560
Actually, I haven't made up my mind yet.

77
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,750
Made up your mind about what?

78
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:22,560
About whether

79
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,540
to go abroad or not.

80
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,390
You've already got the scholarship,

81
00:04:28,390 --> 00:04:30,070
and now you tell me you haven't decided?

82
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:30,970
Cao Xin,

83
00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:32,920
isn't that a bit too carefree?

84
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,520
I wouldn't call it carefree.

85
00:04:34,670 --> 00:04:36,730
I wasn't exactly complimenting you.

86
00:04:37,310 --> 00:04:37,920
You know,

87
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,750
I've never really

88
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:43,000
liked studying finance.

89
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:46,070
It's just that my dad
thought it was a good major,

90
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:48,210
with better job prospects,

91
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:50,970
so he made the decision for me.

92
00:04:52,150 --> 00:04:53,409
After I got to Beining,

93
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,370
I suddenly felt

94
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,010
like a string

95
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,840
that had been taut for years

96
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,370
finally loosened.

97
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,870
Without my dad watching over me,

98
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:05,930
and without Qi Shi competing with me,

99
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,510
I suddenly didn't know

100
00:05:08,510 --> 00:05:09,440
why I should keep

101
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,020
studying hard.

102
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,780
Until what you said woke me up.

103
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,680
It's all up to you?

104
00:05:17,990 --> 00:05:18,790
Right.

105
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:21,480
I thought,

106
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,240
being in

107
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:27,120
such a good university like Beining,

108
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,870
it'd be a waste not to study hard.

109
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,270
I'd be the one losing out.

110
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:31,950
So I

111
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:33,760
decided to give it a try,

112
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,070
to fulfill my dad's

113
00:05:36,070 --> 00:05:37,670
expectations one last time.

114
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,100
If I succeeded,

115
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,750
I'd have an answer for him.

116
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:41,480
If I failed,

117
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,690
I could face it calmly.

118
00:05:45,270 --> 00:05:45,800
At least,

119
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:48,010
I wouldn't let myself down.

120
00:05:50,070 --> 00:05:51,670
Well, you've succeeded now.

121
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,560
It's time to make

122
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,560
your next choice.

123
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,350
Right.

124
00:05:54,540 --> 00:05:55,650
Honestly, during

125
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:57,810
the process of applying to MacDonald,

126
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:59,270
I've actually developed

127
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:00,670
a bit of attachment to it.

128
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:02,590
Maybe I'm a finance whiz.

129
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:09,750
But we never know

130
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,920
what kind of future

131
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,860
our current choices will lead to.

132
00:06:18,320 --> 00:06:19,720
That's the hardest part.

133
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:23,270
Do you think we like burgers,

134
00:06:23,270 --> 00:06:23,920
fries,

135
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,630
and fried chicken

136
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:26,680
because of our fantasy

137
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,560
of that colorful

138
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,160
foreign lifestyle?

139
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,120
Once we can

140
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,200
eat them every day,

141
00:06:31,230 --> 00:06:32,230
whenever we want,

142
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:34,310
maybe

143
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:35,750
it won't

144
00:06:35,750 --> 00:06:36,560
taste as good.

145
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:41,880
Well, you won't know until you try.

146
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:43,560
When I get to MacDonald,

147
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:44,480
I'm definitely trying

148
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,060
their burgers

149
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:46,460
to see if they're better.

150
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:50,510
Good luck with everything.

151
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:51,270
Hope you find

152
00:06:51,909 --> 00:06:53,640
better-tasting burgers soon.

153
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:55,070
To us.

154
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:02,760
Chief Cao,

155
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:03,690
having a drink?

156
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,120
Waiting for Aihua, huh?

157
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,190
He usually shows up
around this time every Friday.

158
00:07:12,190 --> 00:07:13,680
Something might have held him up

159
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,240
today.

160
00:07:18,430 --> 00:07:19,240
Check, please.

161
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,680
Sure.

162
00:07:20,950 --> 00:07:22,010
We're heading out.

163
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:23,070
Okay, take care.

164
00:07:26,950 --> 00:07:28,010
Your food's ready.

165
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:28,950
Great.

166
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,430
Cao,

167
00:07:40,150 --> 00:07:41,010
we're leaving.

168
00:07:41,070 --> 00:07:42,270
Go easy on the drinks.

169
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:51,430
Cao,

170
00:07:52,110 --> 00:07:53,750
we're about to close.

171
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,230
[Qi's Lifestyle Supermarket]

172
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:23,310
Qinglian.

173
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,000
Lingzhi.

174
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:27,010
I'm here to buy some fruit.

175
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:27,970
Some fruit, huh.

176
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,070
Look, these oranges are quite fresh.

177
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:30,740
Really?

178
00:08:31,140 --> 00:08:32,080
They just arrived?

179
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:32,390
Yes.

180
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,559
The watermelons are new too.

181
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:36,539
You have watermelon now?

182
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,850
That's a rare treat.

183
00:08:38,429 --> 00:08:39,490
I'll get one to try.

184
00:08:39,669 --> 00:08:40,000
Here.

185
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,230
Qinglian,

186
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,220
have you heard?

187
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,670
That Cao

188
00:08:45,270 --> 00:08:46,600
moved out. Did you know?

189
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:50,630
Cao moved out?

190
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:52,510
I heard

191
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:54,640
his boy, Cao Xin, is doing well.

192
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:55,480
He got into

193
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,640
some grad school abroad.

194
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,920
So they need the money fast.

195
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,600
And Cao's taking early retirement.

196
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:03,260
He doesn't have much saved up.

197
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,150
I heard

198
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,500
he even sold the house.

199
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:10,530
Parents will do anything for their kids.

200
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:12,330
It hasn't been easy

201
00:09:12,550 --> 00:09:13,860
for Cao all these years,

202
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:14,360
right?

203
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:16,850
Alright.

204
00:09:17,010 --> 00:09:18,010
That's all I need.

205
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,260
Here, Qinglian.

206
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:20,240
Weigh this for me. How much?

207
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:20,570
Sure.

208
00:09:29,530 --> 00:09:30,550
Dad, come on in.

209
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:32,970
Age is really

210
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:34,680
catching up with me.

211
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:35,960
I just took a few steps up the stairs.

212
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,750
It's okay. I got it.

213
00:09:36,750 --> 00:09:37,390
Who's here?

214
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,440
And I'm already exhausted.

215
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:38,670
Who's here?

216
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:39,930
I'm sweating all over.

217
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:40,960
Dad.

218
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:42,120
Doudou.

219
00:09:42,510 --> 00:09:42,960
Look who's here.

220
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:43,720
Let Grandpa

221
00:09:44,290 --> 00:09:45,290
take a look at you.

222
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:46,870
Come to Grandpa.

223
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:49,200
I missed you so much.

224
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,600
You've gained weight again.

225
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,140
Next time,

226
00:09:51,140 --> 00:09:52,400
-Have a seat.
-I guess…

227
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,050
I guess

228
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,360
I won't be able to hold you anymore.

229
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:54,910
Take it easy.

230
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:55,600
Take it easy.

231
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,080
Si,

232
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,960
get Dad a pair of slippers.

233
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:58,600
No, I...

234
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,440
I forgot. I'll do it myself.

235
00:09:59,440 --> 00:09:59,840
It's fine. I'll get them.

236
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,150
It's okay. Just let her get them.

237
00:10:01,150 --> 00:10:01,810
Have a seat.

238
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:04,790
Dad,

239
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,650
how come you came alone?

240
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:07,790
Where's Grandpa?

241
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:08,720
I was going to come

242
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,320
with him.

243
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,010
But I figured your grandpa

244
00:10:11,010 --> 00:10:11,750
felt a bit embarrassed

245
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,800
to come.

246
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,080
He insisted he was

247
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,630
going to visit some relatives.

248
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,120
So I thought, fine, let him go.

249
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:17,720
I'll talk

250
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,250
to him again some other day.

251
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,030
Let me do it.

252
00:10:20,630 --> 00:10:21,000
I...

253
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,320
Dad, just sit there.

254
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,680
Keep Doudou company.

255
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:24,550
Si,

256
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:26,600
when you have time these days,

257
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:27,240
take Dad out to buy

258
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,440
some trendy clothes.

259
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:31,170
What's wrong with my clothes?

260
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:32,550
Don't waste your money.

261
00:10:32,550 --> 00:10:33,670
My clothes are fine.

262
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,330
No problem.

263
00:10:34,510 --> 00:10:34,870
Dad,

264
00:10:35,260 --> 00:10:36,320
you've moved from the countryside

265
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,320
to the big city now.

266
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,000
You need a whole new wardrobe.

267
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:39,920
Besides,

268
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,880
we live in a high-end neighborhood now.

269
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:43,480
When you take a stroll around,

270
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,300
we don't want
people looking down on us, right?

271
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:46,200
Dad, also,

272
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,150
it's good that you quit
that security guard job.

273
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,000
Otherwise, if people find out

274
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:49,890
my dad is a director

275
00:10:49,890 --> 00:10:51,550
and my father-in-law is a security guard,

276
00:10:51,550 --> 00:10:52,030
that's

277
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,570
just embarrassing.

278
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,270
Right.

279
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:54,670
Dad,

280
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,290
just ignore whatever gibberish he said.

281
00:10:56,290 --> 00:10:57,390
That's just how he is.

282
00:10:57,390 --> 00:10:58,750
He has a point.

283
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,630
I'll go buy some tomorrow.

284
00:11:00,630 --> 00:11:01,270
Tomorrow it is.

285
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:01,840
Okay, Dad.

286
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,720
Si can take you.

287
00:11:02,790 --> 00:11:03,510
I'll pay for it.

288
00:11:03,510 --> 00:11:04,720
Dad, I'll take your luggage

289
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:05,320
inside.

290
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:07,000
I-I'll help you with that.

291
00:11:07,110 --> 00:11:07,720
It's fine.

292
00:11:07,750 --> 00:11:08,270
I'll go.

293
00:11:08,290 --> 00:11:09,000
You rest for a bit.

294
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,460
Doudou,

295
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:11,480
I'm going to take a look.

296
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,080
Dad,

297
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,840
I've already set up the bed.

298
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,440
You and Grandpa can come stay

299
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:18,520
whenever you want.

300
00:11:21,150 --> 00:11:21,670
Si,

301
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,040
sorry to trouble you.

302
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,240
What are you saying?

303
00:11:26,900 --> 00:11:27,360
I couldn't be happier

304
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,650
to have you here.

305
00:11:29,670 --> 00:11:30,200
Besides,

306
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:32,200
you can help me

307
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,400
keep an eye on Doudou.

308
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,030
Xin.

309
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:37,220
Just letting you know,

310
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,360
Dad will be staying with me from now on.

311
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,870
Come over whenever you're on break.

312
00:11:40,870 --> 00:11:42,730
I'll arrange everything for you.

313
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:44,980
No need to be so polite with me.

314
00:11:44,980 --> 00:11:46,220
Am I that stingy?

315
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:48,800
Waiting for you.

316
00:11:50,910 --> 00:11:51,440
Um,

317
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,510
Xuanyu won't let it slip, will he?

318
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:55,550
I've warned him.

319
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:56,720
He won't

320
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:58,340
blab about important stuff.

321
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:00,960
Cao Xin must absolutely not

322
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,620
know about selling the house.

323
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:04,480
Don't worry.

324
00:12:10,630 --> 00:12:12,160
It hasn't been easy, honey.

325
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:14,750
Let me pour you a drink first.

326
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:15,720
Okay.

327
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,860
After years of working from dawn to dusk,

328
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:21,810
we've finally

329
00:12:21,810 --> 00:12:23,420
paid off the debt.

330
00:12:24,870 --> 00:12:25,550
We won't

331
00:12:25,570 --> 00:12:26,810
have to work so hard

332
00:12:27,150 --> 00:12:28,320
anymore, right?

333
00:12:28,630 --> 00:12:30,090
Come on, let's celebrate.

334
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:41,840
Honey,

335
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:42,960
why don't we

336
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:44,030
hire a clerk

337
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,130
like everyone else?

338
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:48,270
Then we can be the

339
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,840
landlord and landlady.

340
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,390
Just lying in bed

341
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,850
counting money every day.

342
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,240
Five, ten, fifteen, twenty...

343
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,600
Five, ten, fifteen, twenty...

344
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,870
No more working

345
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,960
so hard every day.

346
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,790
You're just saying that.

347
00:13:00,150 --> 00:13:01,270
You think paying off the debt

348
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,270
means we're done?

349
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:04,200
Our son's coming back soon.

350
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,910
Are you going to take care of him?

351
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:07,780
He'll need to get married

352
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:09,360
and have kids.

353
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:11,280
Are you going to help with that?

354
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,930
Which of those doesn't cost money?

355
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:16,000
I've got you

356
00:13:16,030 --> 00:13:17,510
as a free laborer.

357
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,000
Why wouldn't I use you?

358
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,330
Why would I spend money?

359
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:23,240
Fine.

360
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:25,800
I accept my fate.

361
00:13:27,150 --> 00:13:28,240
I, Qi Aihua,

362
00:13:28,390 --> 00:13:29,790
am just destined to toil.

363
00:13:30,150 --> 00:13:31,000
I'll be a hired hand

364
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,260
for the rest of my life.

365
00:13:32,510 --> 00:13:33,080
I'll just

366
00:13:33,510 --> 00:13:34,360
be a hired hand.

367
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:36,120
I'll just follow you, my landlady,

368
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,840
and get free food and drinks.
How about that?

369
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:39,100
You have to support me.

370
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:43,710
Now we just wait for our son to come back.

371
00:13:44,150 --> 00:13:46,010
The Cao family has moved away too.

372
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,320
Our life should get

373
00:13:48,630 --> 00:13:50,560
smoother and smoother from now on.

374
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,250
What's going on over there?

375
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:00,600
What's with the howling next door?

376
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:02,930
The two young people who just moved in

377
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:05,150
have a huge wolfdog.

378
00:14:06,050 --> 00:14:07,030
I almost got bitten by it

379
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:08,390
when I came back today.

380
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:11,840
Honey,

381
00:14:13,750 --> 00:14:14,950
why don't we move too?

382
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,230
Move where?

383
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,840
The provincial capital.

384
00:14:18,630 --> 00:14:19,030
Look,

385
00:14:19,790 --> 00:14:21,650
honey, here's what I'm thinking.

386
00:14:22,210 --> 00:14:23,940
When Qi Zhi gets out of prison,

387
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,870
the neighbors' gossip...

388
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:28,120
Right?

389
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,800
The gossip alone could drown us.

390
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:32,600
Let's not let the kid

391
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,930
suffer any more trauma.

392
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:35,510
Good idea.

393
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:39,510
Haven't you been
thinking about our daughter?

394
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,790
We'll be closer to her,

395
00:14:40,790 --> 00:14:43,050
so we don't have to travel back and forth.

396
00:14:43,930 --> 00:14:44,590
Let's move.

397
00:14:52,930 --> 00:14:53,570
Over here.

398
00:14:53,470 --> 00:14:56,890
[Shenguang City]

399
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:54,340
One, two, three.

400
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:54,930
I have

401
00:14:55,140 --> 00:14:56,150
eight boxes here.

402
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:57,480
Do you want them?

403
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,630
Ours are all pure cotton.

404
00:14:58,630 --> 00:14:59,560
All pure cotton.

405
00:15:12,410 --> 00:15:13,080
Hurry.

406
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,440
Take a look!

407
00:15:21,790 --> 00:15:23,080
Wholesale clearance!

408
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,630
Come on. Okay.

409
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,630
Be careful.

410
00:15:55,930 --> 00:15:57,430
[Clearance Sale]

411
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,020
Hey beautiful.

412
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:04,360
Whatever color,

413
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:06,120
style, size,

414
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:07,340
or quantity you want—

415
00:16:07,790 --> 00:16:08,870
you always time it perfectly

416
00:16:08,870 --> 00:16:10,870
and come when it's clearance stock.

417
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,550
That's the cheapest way.

418
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:15,370
Calculated the probability.

419
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:16,600
I did my homework.

420
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:18,680
That's impressive.

421
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,730
Then let's do a flat price.

422
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:22,790
1,200.

423
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,370
I won't return them.

424
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:28,410
I want the bottom price.

425
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:29,630
880.

426
00:16:31,950 --> 00:16:32,510
Deal.

427
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,160
All counted.

428
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:45,510
Sir,

429
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,670
how much for
a portion of rice noodle rolls?

430
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:48,670
Eight yuan.

431
00:16:49,110 --> 00:16:50,170
I'll have one then.

432
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,030
Here.

433
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:52,740
Okay, okay.

434
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:03,840
The bus is here.

435
00:17:13,109 --> 00:17:14,510
Make way. Careful. Watch the car.

436
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:15,109
Make way.

437
00:17:17,069 --> 00:17:17,589
Thanks.

438
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,510
Sir,

439
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:29,950
make me a bowl of noodles.

440
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,130
Coming right up.

441
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:34,720
Shi. Shi.

442
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:37,830
Uncle Cao.

443
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:38,790
It really is you.

444
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,330
Come.

445
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,350
Wait, what are you doing in Haizhou?

446
00:17:41,350 --> 00:17:42,240
Sit, sit here.

447
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:43,960
Sit.

448
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,410
Sit down.

449
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:50,530
We haven't seen each other for a while.

450
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:51,520
You've changed.

451
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,480
You've grown into a young woman.

452
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:56,350
It's too messy.

453
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:57,950
I haven't had time to tidy up.

454
00:17:58,590 --> 00:18:00,320
I didn't expect to run into you.

455
00:18:02,400 --> 00:18:04,660
I'm planning to sell clothes in Haizhou.

456
00:18:04,870 --> 00:18:05,890
I took over a shop.

457
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:07,690
It opens in a couple of days.

458
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:08,590
I just came back from Shenguang

459
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,790
with a batch of goods.

460
00:18:10,510 --> 00:18:11,970
Aren't you tired

461
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:13,730
carrying two big bags like this

462
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:14,880
all by yourself?

463
00:18:17,510 --> 00:18:18,110
Uncle Cao,

464
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:20,640
what brings you to Haizhou?

465
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:21,960
Your Grandpa Cao and I

466
00:18:21,960 --> 00:18:23,480
have moved to Haizhou.

467
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:25,390
We're staying at Si's place now.

468
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:27,160
I went back to Qingwu
for some errands today

469
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,160
and got back late.

470
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:29,830
I came here for a bowl of noodles

471
00:18:29,830 --> 00:18:30,760
and ran into you.

472
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,530
How is Si doing?

473
00:18:34,750 --> 00:18:36,810
She's good. Everyone is doing great.

474
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,030
Cao Xin got into

475
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:39,170
MacDonald University.

476
00:18:39,170 --> 00:18:40,700
He's going for grad school.

477
00:18:43,510 --> 00:18:44,200
That's great.

478
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:45,260
He's always done well.

479
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:46,320
Way better than me.

480
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:52,090
The noodles are ready.

481
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:06,510
Take your time.

482
00:19:06,510 --> 00:19:07,710
Thank you, Uncle Cao.

483
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:15,880
Shi,

484
00:19:17,510 --> 00:19:19,270
you shouldn't say that.

485
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:22,790
You and Cao Xin are both good kids.

486
00:19:23,750 --> 00:19:25,210
Both of you are excellent.

487
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:29,010
Ever since that time...

488
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:35,290
We haven't seen each other for so long,

489
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,640
but I've been asking Cao Xin

490
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,590
about you.

491
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,080
I know you're doing well,

492
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,070
but

493
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:45,570
you've also faced many difficulties,

494
00:19:46,110 --> 00:19:47,440
suffered grievances,

495
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:48,890
and worked hard.

496
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,350
I wanted

497
00:19:51,160 --> 00:19:52,360
to help but couldn't.

498
00:19:57,410 --> 00:19:58,670
Did Aihua and Qinglian

499
00:19:58,770 --> 00:19:59,400
come with you

500
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,240
this time?

501
00:20:03,510 --> 00:20:04,920
They're in Qingwu.

502
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:05,960
I figured

503
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:08,000
I'd go back to see them

504
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:09,160
once my shop

505
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:10,750
is up and running

506
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,640
and I've made a name for myself.

507
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,370
Good for you.

508
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:14,850
Very ambitious.

509
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,000
I just like

510
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:17,550
kids like you.

511
00:20:18,110 --> 00:20:19,350
I may be old,

512
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:21,240
but I'll always be your

513
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:22,240
closest...

514
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,240
closest neighbor.

515
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:27,110
Since we're both in Haizhou now

516
00:20:27,110 --> 00:20:28,910
and you're selling things here,

517
00:20:29,030 --> 00:20:30,070
be sure to tell me

518
00:20:30,470 --> 00:20:32,500
anytime you need anything.

519
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,210
I'm always here for you.

520
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,340
No problem.

521
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:38,440
You're like family to me,

522
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,000
my strongest backup.

523
00:20:41,240 --> 00:20:42,830
It seems my business journey

524
00:20:42,830 --> 00:20:44,030
is bound to be smooth.

525
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:45,390
Uncle Cao,

526
00:20:45,690 --> 00:20:46,550
since you're in Haizhou,

527
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:47,960
let me treat you to beef.

528
00:20:48,410 --> 00:20:50,160
We can order one portion and share.

529
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:52,020
Sir, add an extra portion of beef.

530
00:20:53,110 --> 00:20:54,570
Two portions. Make it two.

531
00:20:54,790 --> 00:20:55,120
Okay.

532
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,200
It's my treat.

533
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,110
I'm paying.

534
00:20:57,400 --> 00:20:58,030
Thank you.

535
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:12,310
Qi Shi.

536
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:13,320
Hurry up.

537
00:21:13,510 --> 00:21:14,350
It's time.

538
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,960
Just put it here. It's symmetrical.

539
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,320
Over here.

540
00:21:19,510 --> 00:21:19,970
Come on.

541
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,750
Stand still. In a line.

542
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:25,280
How is it?

543
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:30,590
Hey, Boss Qi,

544
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,250
why are you being so shy?

545
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,240
Who's shy?

546
00:21:33,920 --> 00:21:34,510
Does the word "shy"

547
00:21:34,510 --> 00:21:35,440
even apply to me?

548
00:21:35,550 --> 00:21:37,720
S-Stop interrupting.

549
00:21:38,400 --> 00:21:40,200
You be quiet. Let Qi Shi speak.

550
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:42,000
Today is her big day.

551
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:49,160
Hello?

552
00:21:54,030 --> 00:21:55,110
Welcome, everyone,

553
00:21:55,110 --> 00:21:56,590
to the grand opening

554
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:57,880
of All the Rage.

555
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:58,680
Bravo!

556
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,510
Everyone here

557
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:06,750
has witnessed the entire process of

558
00:22:07,310 --> 00:22:09,310
this shop being built from scratch.

559
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:13,680
Indeed, since I left home

560
00:22:14,350 --> 00:22:15,750
to make a living on my own,

561
00:22:17,070 --> 00:22:19,890
I've been through a lot of times

562
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,550
I'd rather not recall.

563
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,520
Well, let's not talk about that.

564
00:22:27,310 --> 00:22:28,110
Fortunately,

565
00:22:28,830 --> 00:22:29,560
along the way

566
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:31,480
I've gained a lot of

567
00:22:31,510 --> 00:22:32,510
precious wealth,

568
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:35,310
which is you guys.

569
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:38,000
Yuanyuan,

570
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:39,300
a talented girl

571
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,400
who can draw and design,

572
00:22:42,070 --> 00:22:43,760
a colleague I really admire.

573
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:45,970
Well, if things

574
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:47,480
ever don't work out,

575
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:48,480
come to me.

576
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,060
I've got your back.

577
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:51,640
Okay.

578
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,790
And Wang and Bai,

579
00:22:58,350 --> 00:23:00,070
two friends I met
when I was setting up a stall

580
00:23:00,070 --> 00:23:01,200
at the night market.

581
00:23:02,510 --> 00:23:03,720
I couldn't

582
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:05,440
have survived

583
00:23:06,350 --> 00:23:08,610
and made it big in the night market street

584
00:23:09,030 --> 00:23:10,310
without your help.

585
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,550
I'll give you two—

586
00:23:11,550 --> 00:23:12,200
Don't.

587
00:23:12,750 --> 00:23:13,350
Cut it out.

588
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:14,960
I didn't help you.

589
00:23:15,090 --> 00:23:16,400
All I did was
chase you all over the street

590
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:17,400
and get yelled at by you guys.

591
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:17,880
Right?

592
00:23:18,110 --> 00:23:19,440
You yelled at me plenty.

593
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:21,240
Well, I owe it to you, don't I?

594
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:21,830
Look,

595
