889
00:37:35,440 --> 00:37:36,500
and made you worry.

890
00:37:43,190 --> 00:37:44,170
Alright.

891
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:44,760
What's past is past.

892
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:46,160
Sorry, I've let you down.

893
00:37:47,140 --> 00:37:48,670
We're family. What are you

894
00:37:48,670 --> 00:37:49,440
talking about?

895
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,800
Why keep bringing it up?

896
00:37:51,070 --> 00:37:51,600
Exactly.

897
00:37:52,590 --> 00:37:54,400
Let's not talk about the past anymore.

898
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:54,880
No more.

899
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:00,030
Dad, Mom.

900
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:01,800
I've let you down.

901
00:38:02,110 --> 00:38:03,110
I'll kowtow to you

902
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,280
to apologize.

903
00:38:04,590 --> 00:38:05,320
Sorry.

904
00:38:06,550 --> 00:38:07,280
Sorry.

905
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:08,840
Sorry.

906
00:38:10,190 --> 00:38:11,000
Sorry.

907
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:12,840
Get up.

908
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:14,360
Get up.

909
00:38:14,930 --> 00:38:15,540
Get up.

910
00:38:18,230 --> 00:38:19,360
Dad, Mom.

911
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:20,660
From now on,

912
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:22,940
I'll definitely take good care of you

913
00:38:23,070 --> 00:38:24,840
and make up for all these years.

914
00:38:26,110 --> 00:38:27,480
Alright.

915
00:38:28,230 --> 00:38:29,000
Son,

916
00:38:29,630 --> 00:38:31,030
you've finally grown up.

917
00:38:32,190 --> 00:38:34,150
Our hard days are over.

918
00:38:36,040 --> 00:38:36,960
Silly boy,

919
00:38:39,230 --> 00:38:41,430
you've learned your lesson now, right?

920
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:44,000
It's okay.

921
00:38:45,030 --> 00:38:46,630
Mom and Dad are here with you.

922
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:48,070
We'll start over.

923
00:38:50,110 --> 00:38:50,840
Start over.

924
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:58,400
Good boy. Here.

925
00:38:58,510 --> 00:38:59,840
I'll heat this up again.

926
00:39:01,150 --> 00:39:02,210
Don't bother, Dad.

927
00:39:02,880 --> 00:39:03,740
Let's not wait.

928
00:39:03,950 --> 00:39:04,890
He must be held up

929
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:05,720
by something.

930
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:09,560
Today's Doudou's birthday.

931
00:39:09,590 --> 00:39:09,990
Right.

932
00:39:10,070 --> 00:39:11,470
And Cao Xin just got back.

933
00:39:12,030 --> 00:39:12,630
Let's eat.

934
00:39:12,710 --> 00:39:14,440
See if my cooking has improved.

935
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:15,400
Come on.

936
00:39:17,290 --> 00:39:18,190
He's back.

937
00:39:21,920 --> 00:39:22,400
Xuanyu.

938
00:39:22,510 --> 00:39:23,680
Why are you so late?

939
00:39:23,800 --> 00:39:24,600
Didn't I tell—

940
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:27,140
You've been drinking?

941
00:39:31,030 --> 00:39:31,590
Xin.

942
00:39:31,850 --> 00:39:32,450
Xuanyu.

943
00:39:33,720 --> 00:39:35,180
Looking handsome as ever.

944
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:36,930
Son.

945
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:37,410
Look

946
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:39,070
what I got you.

947
00:39:39,070 --> 00:39:39,840
Thank you, Dad.

948
00:39:39,840 --> 00:39:42,100
-Yeah, thank your dad.
-You're welcome.

949
00:39:42,110 --> 00:39:42,940
Wait a minute.

950
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:45,630
Today is

951
00:39:46,030 --> 00:39:47,090
my son's birthday,

952
00:39:47,280 --> 00:39:48,710
and my brother-in-law is here.

953
00:39:48,710 --> 00:39:51,090
So we've got a birthday party
plus a welcome dinner.

954
00:39:51,090 --> 00:39:53,030
Double the joy. Let's drink to that!

955
00:39:53,030 --> 00:39:53,490
Come on.

956
00:39:53,590 --> 00:39:54,190
Alright.

957
00:39:54,220 --> 00:39:55,780
Don't start drinking right away.

958
00:39:55,780 --> 00:39:56,760
Let's eat the cake first,

959
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:57,150
okay?

960
00:39:58,110 --> 00:39:59,550
Our son's been waiting for a long time.

961
00:39:59,550 --> 00:40:00,810
Xuanyu, I don't drink.

962
00:40:01,550 --> 00:40:02,080
How about

963
00:40:02,190 --> 00:40:03,390
we eat the cake first?

964
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:07,540
Wearing glasses, acting like a student.

965
00:40:09,550 --> 00:40:10,950
Why did you drink so much?

966
00:40:11,520 --> 00:40:12,080
Sit down.

967
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:12,960
Xin,

968
00:40:13,840 --> 00:40:14,800
if you go abroad

969
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:16,030
in the future,

970
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:17,590
and you're so timid about

971
00:40:17,590 --> 00:40:19,110
drinking and doing things,

972
00:40:19,110 --> 00:40:21,040
won't the foreigners laugh at you?

973
00:40:21,710 --> 00:40:22,650
I'm going there to study,

974
00:40:22,650 --> 00:40:23,870
not to drink.

975
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:27,170
Top students sure talk tough.

976
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:29,440
Dad, a toast to you.

977
00:40:30,030 --> 00:40:30,590
Xuanyu,

978
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:32,400
let's eat the cake first.

979
00:40:32,550 --> 00:40:33,280
The kid is hungry.

980
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:34,610
Look, it's already 9 PM.

981
00:40:35,230 --> 00:40:36,670
We can drink after eating the cake,

982
00:40:36,670 --> 00:40:37,230
okay?

983
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:37,610
Okay.

984
00:40:38,070 --> 00:40:39,730
Let's eat the cake first then.

985
00:40:39,960 --> 00:40:40,760
We're happy today.

986
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:42,240
Let's just have a little drink.

987
00:40:42,240 --> 00:40:42,920
Look at you,

988
00:40:43,850 --> 00:40:45,050
what's with your hat?

989
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:48,650
If you ask me,

990
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:52,710
I'm not against you
going abroad for grad school.

991
00:40:53,420 --> 00:40:54,830
It's natural to aim high.

992
00:40:55,230 --> 00:40:56,520
Nothing wrong with that.

993
00:40:56,520 --> 00:40:58,890
But we have to do the math.

994
00:41:00,690 --> 00:41:03,090
Spending a fortune
over two or three years.

995
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:05,400
I'm not saying studying is useless.

996
00:41:06,590 --> 00:41:08,480
I'm just worried you'll study

997
00:41:08,880 --> 00:41:10,450
yourself into a corner.

998
00:41:11,080 --> 00:41:13,110
Weren't you Qingwu's top scorer

999
00:41:13,110 --> 00:41:14,460
on the college entrance exam?

1000
00:41:14,460 --> 00:41:15,030
Right?

1001
00:41:15,190 --> 00:41:17,250
If all you do is bury your head in books

1002
00:41:17,360 --> 00:41:19,760
and never make something real of yourself,

1003
00:41:19,760 --> 00:41:20,760
that'd be a waste.

1004
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:23,220
How about this?

1005
00:41:24,030 --> 00:41:24,690
From now on,

1006
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:25,940
you work with me.

1007
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,170
I'll show you the world.

1008
00:41:29,000 --> 00:41:30,030
You can be my assistant.

1009
00:41:30,030 --> 00:41:31,560
I'll pay you 10,000 a month.

1010
00:41:32,110 --> 00:41:34,040
Rent, utilities,

1011
00:41:34,670 --> 00:41:35,810
and all that stuff—

1012
00:41:36,190 --> 00:41:37,190
I'll cover it all.

1013
00:41:37,510 --> 00:41:38,630
All you gotta do is carry my bag

1014
00:41:38,630 --> 00:41:39,630
and pour me water.

1015
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:42,230
So don't waste that money going abroad.

1016
00:41:43,150 --> 00:41:43,610
Xuanyu,

1017
00:41:44,070 --> 00:41:45,030
you guys go talk over there.

1018
00:41:45,030 --> 00:41:46,110
I'll clean up here.

1019
00:41:46,190 --> 00:41:47,590
Dad, am I right?

1020
00:41:48,290 --> 00:41:49,550
Think about how much effort you put

1021
00:41:49,550 --> 00:41:50,710
into sending him abroad.

1022
00:41:50,710 --> 00:41:52,030
And now, at a time like this, you took

1023
00:41:52,030 --> 00:41:52,840
early retirement,

1024
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:54,510
sold the ancestral house,
and went to work as a security guard.

1025
00:41:54,510 --> 00:41:55,480
-Zhou Xuanyu!
-That's insane.

1026
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:56,250
Shut up!

1027
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:58,030
It was all to save money
to send you abroad.

1028
00:41:58,030 --> 00:41:59,020
You're drunk and talking nonsense.

1029
00:41:59,020 --> 00:41:59,590
Tell me about it.

1030
00:41:59,590 --> 00:42:00,120
Hurry up.

1031
00:42:00,190 --> 00:42:00,590
Go to your room.

1032
00:42:00,590 --> 00:42:01,630
Selling the ancestral house...

1033
00:42:01,630 --> 00:42:03,030
That took some serious determination.

1034
00:42:03,030 --> 00:42:04,710
You'd better make something of yourself,

1035
00:42:04,710 --> 00:42:05,110
right?

1036
00:42:05,360 --> 00:42:06,230
To your room.

1037
00:42:06,480 --> 00:42:07,920
I'm just chatting with my brother-in-law.

1038
00:42:07,920 --> 00:42:09,230
Go back. Stop making a scene.

1039
00:42:09,230 --> 00:42:10,730
I just want you to know that

1040
00:42:10,840 --> 00:42:12,030
I, Zhou Xuanyu, can take care

1041
00:42:12,030 --> 00:42:14,020
of your whole family all by myself.

1042
00:42:14,040 --> 00:42:14,480
Dad,

1043
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:17,330
when did you sell the house?

1044
00:42:18,360 --> 00:42:20,560
And you're working as a security guard?

1045
00:42:23,280 --> 00:42:24,030
I haven't had

1046
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:26,770
a chance to tell you yet.

1047
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:41,500
I feel sick.

1048
00:42:42,280 --> 00:42:43,340
You feel sick, huh?

1049
00:42:43,520 --> 00:42:44,710
So you let the whole family
suffers with you.

1050
00:42:44,710 --> 00:42:45,390
Happy now?

1051
00:42:45,880 --> 00:42:46,400
Yeah.

1052
00:42:47,710 --> 00:42:48,770
You're a grown man.

1053
00:42:49,110 --> 00:42:49,840
Don't you know

1054
00:42:49,840 --> 00:42:50,550
what to say

1055
00:42:50,570 --> 00:42:51,630
and what not to say?

1056
00:42:51,980 --> 00:42:52,630
You completely ruined

1057
00:42:52,630 --> 00:42:53,960
a perfectly good day.

1058
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:57,040
I'm going to check on Cao Xin.

1059
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:58,930
Honey, where are you going?

1060
00:42:59,510 --> 00:43:00,640
Where are you going?

1061
00:43:01,480 --> 00:43:02,560
Don't go.
